# Aragorn enters on turn 1 and makes Bot1 the monarch, who draws the Plains at the end step. On turn 3 it attacks as the
# monarch, so no creature can block: its lifelink damage goes through. On turn 4 Bot2's Guerrilla Gorilla deals combat damage
# to the monarch and takes the crown.

[Bot1 Deck]
Volcanic Island
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Aragorn, King of Gondor
Island
Island
Plains
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Guerrilla Gorilla
Forest x10

